    {
      "key": "contactCardStepBody",
      "en": "Optional. Add the details you’d like to share, so it’s easy to stay in touch with people you meet here. Your card isn’t shown on your profile: it’s shared only when you send it in a chat, and only with that person, who then keeps it.",
